  "bodyHash": "b7c6e9caabe576a4",
  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/370614/description_e70be430-efe7-462d-b0e0-d05bbbe7211a.png\" alt=\"Immersive Geology 标志\" width=\"400\" height=\"241\"></div>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/tdMqSf5.png\" alt=\"水平分割线\" width=\"820\" height=\"41\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>模组描述</strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Immersive Geology</strong> 是 <strong>Immersive Engineering</strong> 的附加模组，通过引入新矿物和高级工程选项来丰富游戏世界。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">旨在与 Immersive Engineering 及其他注重科技与真实感的模组无缝集成，Immersive Geology 引入了以下内容：</p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:left\">\n<li>新的矿脉与矿石，丰富探索与开采体验</li>\n<li>更多大型机器结构，用于高级资源加工</li>\n<li>精细的工程工具与机械，优化生产流程</li>\n<li>请注意：此为全面重构，因此部分原版矿石已被移除出自然生成。（如需恢复可在配置文件中调整）</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><br>本模组专为资深工程师、矿工与生存爱好者打造，旨在提供更丰富、更具回报的资源采集与工业化体验。通过这些特性，我希望分享现实世界中塑造我们建造世界之材料的工艺与应用理念。~<em>Muddykat</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;<strong>最新开发快照</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yh-Uz38ddXk\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>最新开发者教程</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ycxrnk6jeBY\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/tdMqSf5.png\" alt=\"水平分割线\" width=\"820\" height=\"41\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>工程部团队</strong><strong><br></strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n<div style=\"width:200px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/muddykat-tech\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <strong>Muddykats</strong> </a> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://static-cdn.jtvnw.net/jtv_user_pictures/60495202-995b-4149-a11e-1e9e84a1b384-profile_image-300x300.jpeg\" alt=\"Muddykats 个人资料\" width=\"50\">\n<p><strong>首席开发者</strong></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"width:200px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/unschtalch\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <strong>UnSchtalch</strong> </a> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatars/290185480618770432/d5439eedcc1844324019cbc1625b5ac6.webp?size=512\" alt=\"UnSchtalch 个人资料\" width=\"50\">\n<p><strong>研究与开发模型美术</strong></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"width:200px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/steelblue8\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <strong>SteelBlue8</strong> </a> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://static-cdn.jtvnw.net/jtv_user_pictures/fba7b699-dd7b-41ca-afa0-de35ffa6047d-profile_image-300x300.png\" alt=\"SteelBlue8 个人资料\" width=\"50\">\n<p><strong>物品/方块贴图美术<br></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"width:200px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crimsondragonrider\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <strong>CrimsonDragonRider</strong> </a> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://static-cdn.jtvnw.net/jtv_user_pictures/5e8b4125-96fd-48ae-9a18-b7c2e6c981cd-profile_image-300x300.png\" alt=\"CrimsonDragonRider 个人资料\" width=\"50\">\n<p><strong>项目创始人及贴图美术<br></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"width:200px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Cordyceps22\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <strong>Peter</strong> </a> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatars/810899214406123560/a92a0e41513bf28c64aef7852cd80416.webp?size=512\" alt=\"Peter 个人资料\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\n<p><strong>大型机器建模与美术</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>工程部 Discord 服务器</strong></h2>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/team-immersive-geologys-eco-friendly-tm-server-610912351142674434\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/icons/610912351142674434/9f400c3f7493c2a8149f0ca9afd72dde.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/tdMqSf5.png\" alt=\"水平分割线\" width=\"820\" height=\"41\"></h4>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>兼容性</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Immersive Geology</strong> 的 <strong>1.20.1</strong> 版本基于 <strong>Immersive Engineering 1.20.1-10.1.0-171</strong> 与 <strong>NeoForge 47.1.106</strong> 开发。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>1.16.5</strong> 版本则基于 <strong>Immersive Engineering 1.16.5-5.1.0-148</strong> 与 <strong>Forge 36.2.35</strong> 开发。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/tdMqSf5.png\" alt=\"水平分割线\" width=\"820\" height=\"41\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>更多模组信息</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">《工程师手册》包含模组直接信息，JEI 提供合成详情。如需更深入的指南，请访问模组的维基页面：<a href=\"https://github.com/Immersive-Geology-Team/Immersive-Geology/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</p>",
